{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_title", "source_sha256": "dd01e93940e176745a7dbc98f37bb6b0ef5ebc1b7ebe0c6bfaa629e554debdfe", "ja": "トクベツな場所", "zh": "特别的地方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_synopsis", "source_sha256": "520abff202cf0e95a02a7dbdb34823a0da3bc1c003c8b6ca3a8d0cdff1ccba78", "ja": "センター公演が決まった美希。モデルの仕\n事と重なり十分なレッスンができなかった\nが、春香や翼、可憐、エレナが美希のため\nにとフォローして公演を成功させる。劇場\nは美希にとって大切な場所になっていた。", "zh": "美希的Center公演确定要举办了。虽然因为跟\n模特儿的工作撞期，导致美希没有充分的时间\n可以练习，但春香、翼、可怜和艾琳娜都全力\n支援美希，使得公演圆满成功。剧场成了美希\n心目中很重要的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1000_p", "source_sha256": "85645616f1971703f61b229468f1576a885b837b8faf754b000c2b5a4247c43f", "ja": "（次のセンター公演に向けてレッスンが始まった。\nだが、そのメンバーの中に美希の姿はなく……）", "zh": "（大家已经开始为下次的Center公演练习了，\n但成员中却看不到美希的身影……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "d5ee837f8386a2c21f5609f1becccf7b6e19fd54436f7aa0f188724b066e0e6d", "ja": "みんな、あとちょっとだよ！　\n1、2、3、4……！", "zh": "大家，再撑一下！\n1、2、3、4……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "08da9e71045c8ceb37f7510ec65e1dbaa86ec35e69f7f2dea0d5e75c4122ac46", "ja": "5、6、7、8！\nイェーイ！", "zh": "5、6、7、8！\n耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "2ad3d2de75edccb064a789cb58e23fcad311549c97e36d353d865ae915d53e87", "ja": "い、いぇ～い……はぁ、はぁ……。\nあ、あの、私、ちゃんとできてました……？", "zh": "耶、耶～呼、呼……\n那、那个，我有跳对吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "ae66b0f6f048804b5711c73d423d9f5be1b800896bcafb083c5ba32f01689ca1", "ja": "ウン、カレンもツバサもバッチリ！\nみんなでとーっても気持ちよかったよネ！", "zh": "嗯，可怜和翼都很完美！\n大家一起跳的感觉很棒吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "111211753af179d93c333493bc48f1f42925937c4c104171bb3ecbdbc2609a5e", "ja": "うん、3人でしっかりそろってたから大丈夫！　\nみんな、がんばったね！　お疲れさま♪", "zh": "嗯，三个人的动作都很整齐，不用担心！\n大家都很努力呢！辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "ab20e37d18957702d0e37bfd61672984e964c5303389f522471b6a20bbfc86a5", "ja": "ハルカのアドバイスのおかげだヨ～。\n指の動きまでスイスイ覚えられちゃった！", "zh": "这都要感谢春香给的建议啊～\n连手指的动作都一下就记熟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "986cb02676e2a0493fddef2f5f0a27e93f73ef4310c0e29759a933f89545b4ce", "ja": "わたしも、だいたいはスグに覚えられるけど、\n全部は初めてかもっ。春香さんて、教えるの上手～！", "zh": "我也是，虽然大致上的舞步能马上记住，\n但这好像是头一次记熟全部！春香真会教人～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "ea56fcbf1572c4b5c4a505c2ac21e68074e8d42a5724e3250567d2f0ced9fcaf", "ja": "あはっ、よかった！\nこれならいつ美希が戻ってきても大丈夫だね♪", "zh": "啊哈，那就太好了。\n这样的话，不管美希什么时候回来都没问题呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1009_p", "source_sha256": "73bcb1c79859e09c5ab2d3904eb9922a5c9a08f12876ff68641cb60eb869e81c", "ja": "その美希だけど、さっき連絡があったんだ。\nもう少しでレッスンに合流できるって。", "zh": "说到美希，刚才她那边有联系我了。\n说是再一会儿就能跟大家一起练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e0cd43118ecf77bdb02772b70de11277a4a0cd9b8fa7ddf046586f86f028e9d3", "ja": "あ、じゃあ今日の撮影は終わったんですね？\nファッション雑誌の美希ちゃん特集号！", "zh": "啊，所以她今天的拍摄已经结束了吗？\n听说是时尚杂志要发行美希特辑号！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "b81cdb14b389acbfff29e7184f18ad5cbc62528cf85c8c8eb24543d41118700b", "ja": "ミキ、ひとりで雑誌をジャックしちゃうんでショ？\nすごいよネ！", "zh": "美希会独占整本杂志的篇幅对吧？\n好厉害呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6d8c117f866922d374d7b1ebdb83a4f7de99dc7de3a0c19b4bca2ac34796c47f", "ja": "ああ、編集長がひと目惚れしてくれたらしくて。\nありがたいんだけど、まさか公演と重なるとは……。", "zh": "是啊，总编好像对她一见钟情的样子。\n虽然很感谢对方的赏识，但没想到会跟公演撞期……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6c0c28dddd54904ee98e6dcd81fca352bb5cb18cc6df436fb7b0a6b314108981", "ja": "でも、春香と可憐のおかげで助かったよ。\n美希の振り付けを覚えるのは大変だっただろ？", "zh": "不过多亏有春香和可怜在，真是帮大忙了。\n要记住美希的舞步，肯定不简单吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "2def28062209233949e44d9fbfc7a69f5b8f0947d28e0c5a40d50b366f676588", "ja": "は、はい、難しくて……。でも、美希ちゃんの公演も\n写真も、すごく楽しみですから……。", "zh": "是、是啊，真的很难……可是我很期待看到\n美希的公演跟照片，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "40f7fdef801a2c31f600b6150baf924f6a0241cdb3ecea5a50699bf7eca65de6", "ja": "す、少しでも力になれるなら、\nうれしいです……えへへ。", "zh": "只、只要能帮上一点忙，\n我就很高兴了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "96cdfee32daec94842b127c0e3a1c213b63294390028486f01f1dd8f00169352", "ja": "私も、勉強にもなりますし、頼ってもらえるのも\n嬉しいです！　気にしないでくださいね♪", "zh": "我也是，这对我来说也是学习，而且我也很高兴\n自己能受人倚重！你别放在心上哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "c8840c4159dd7605938946e7dc0edc0366d84bb3d400d9e3cc650f1dbeed3266", "ja": "みんな、お待たせなの～。", "zh": "大家，久等了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "815f366f79405fc7cc71318b3367b543dc56a3919f9a99309010e22190f4ffe4", "ja": "あっ、美希ちゃんだ～♪　ねえ、聞いて聞いて！\nわたしたち今回の振り付け、もう覚えたんだ～！", "zh": "啊，美希回来了～♪欸，跟你说喔！\n我们已经把这次要跳的舞步都记起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "e2637f13b881325317f01e990b9608297af7614d287556a93e4070187020f7ba", "ja": "え、もう覚えちゃったの？\nそれはすごいの！", "zh": "咦？你们已经记起来了？\n大家好厉害呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "168da19caa01eb4e04f27c03164c7c9262697ae3822e02ae63a70f0d844881b3", "ja": "ミキの振り付けはカレンが覚えてくれたんだヨ。\nもうパーフェクトに踊れるからネ♪", "zh": "这都要感谢可怜先记熟了美希的舞步喔。\n她已经可以完美跳完整场了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "0bce6c9a764effd930490c8df05fb914cba5739e60936beb91101b10fe635e99", "ja": "は、春香さんのおかげですっ。そ、それに、\nぜんぜんパーフェクトなんかじゃなくて……。", "zh": "要、要谢谢春香才对。\n而、而且，我根本就还跳不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "877cbbc835fff9aff67d4f3718bfcee343de795f43056d25d7d961ae2992da13", "ja": "可憐ちゃん、美希がすぐに覚えられるようにって、\nすっごくがんばってくれたんだよ♪", "zh": "为了能让美希马上记住舞步，\n可怜真的非常努力喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0168a3f97ad18cffee95ebb011480754ffaa2e17ebea927523f564b6ec370476", "ja": "動きもそろってたし、大丈夫だと思いまーす♪", "zh": "大家动作也已经练得很整齐，我想是不用担心的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1024_p", "source_sha256": "16ad96c391a87066a85cc576d815d6c0f6beb1d26ecb0e565dbc9ef5d4b151b3", "ja": "可憐、俺も問題ないと思うよ。\n美希に見せてやってくれるか？", "zh": "可怜，我也觉得你一定没问题。\n你可以跳给美希看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "c52cf7dd458508a8622670fe32e3903a419ecd600fbd02d7274d041a6b55e78b", "ja": "あうう。わ、わかりました……。　\nそれじゃあ、さ、最初から……いきますね？", "zh": "啊呜呜，我、我知道了……\n那么，我、我要从头……开始跳啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "d98ad921851fbb92e456136368fa7f9b87ddefa2ca64ee425ae11b4adcf85a5b", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……す、すみません。\nわ、私、何回も止まっちゃって……。", "zh": "呼、呼……不、不好意思。\n我、我中间停了这么多次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "dff1f12117a29edd201c802b8b89ccb5c987a75975330f2d3b3afb135e6680fe", "ja": "ううん、すっごくわかりやすかったの！\nありがと可憐、あとでミキのイチゴババロアあげる♪", "zh": "没关系的，可怜跳得非常好懂！\n谢谢可怜，等会请你吃美希的草苺巴巴露亚♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "cdf668b845adedc7ba9d316585b19ab4654baf39423dd3db5deca9c12c3769c3", "ja": "それじゃ、やってみるね。\n翼、エレナも一緒にお願い！", "zh": "那美希就来跳跳看哦。\n翼、艾琳娜，麻烦你们一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "df7fd4d6bb5fd0c6f9791bc405e0449a4b6418038d6c7cb8869883b807d8860c", "ja": "えっ、いきなり合わせるんですか？", "zh": "咦！？马上就要一起跳吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "dc72d6c956377be806ae76aa412580d105910f0f6104c94e0b215cbfd298ebbd", "ja": "あはっ、さすがだネ！\nそれじゃミキ、ツバサ、レッツ・ダンスだヨー！", "zh": "啊哈，美希果然很厉害呢！\n那么美希、翼，Let's Dance吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1032_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "c4785424fbf4ff52c5aaa9d3011ff5a065e2fff2d6e8585e99a107763cc90d5f", "ja": "……ふぅ。だいたい、こんなカンジ？", "zh": "……呼，差不多是这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "63c842fc6ac6ebdd878098c8259ce21d546dfa4d640bf32e95119813359bb8d7", "ja": "す、すごいすご～い！\nだいたいじゃなくて、カンペキですよ～！", "zh": "好、好厉害好厉害～！\n这哪是差不多，根本就是完美啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1035_045kar", "source_sha256": "9d282f4e11c79828cfc5ee5c16a73e291b3f14558fe8b0237329970ff27b77a6", "ja": "わ、私のダンスより、ずっとカッコよくて……！？", "zh": "比、比我跳得还要帅气多了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1036_018ele", "source_sha256": "26373941257cc446ed92d1c25704bc0267fddc321352c10e45a877890199aab1", "ja": "すっごく楽しかったヨー！\nミキ、もう1回！　いいデショ？", "zh": "真的好开心喔～！\n美希，再跳一次！可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "a15ba423c7fef2defff42f7ea300df395f60054e6184eaedc9feb61156848224", "ja": "バッチリだった？　じゃあ～、\n今日のレッスンはおしまいがいいって思うな☆", "zh": "已经很完美了吗？那么～\n美希觉得今天的练习可以结束了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1039_045kar", "source_sha256": "0e5e4bec839ecea544e4a10022299d32d64397afd1a23936612c6c151f0b6348", "ja": "おしまいって……お、おしまい？", "zh": "你是说……结、结束？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4bfd2ee881842b254b32266d2f531ba64fff2df0575ab6df2c52881c7f92c99a", "ja": "はやーい……。あ、でも、美希ちゃん\n始めたばっかりなのに、本当にいいの？", "zh": "好快……但美希才刚开始加入练习而已，\n这么早结束真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1041_003mik", "source_sha256": "a0e9539d5e624e68f680561f7f6e8f1069976da41b33e0abe30d7d508eb4492c", "ja": "うん。ミキ、今日はずーっとお仕事で疲れちゃった。\nゴホウビもらっても、怒られないって思うな。", "zh": "嗯，美希今天工作一整天已经累了，\n现在要点奖赏应该不会被骂吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1042_p", "source_sha256": "9c53463bf614031b2ad3dafc603e2fddddf7f1f957cafcd2ea0f3b705adb098a", "ja": "まあ、たしかに振り付けも覚えちゃったしな。\nよし、ここまでにしようか。", "zh": "也是，反正舞步你也已经记起来了。\n好，今天就先到这吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1043_003mik", "source_sha256": "f6cfad8eaf7874e7efc73059a461863b8ae7b8efa06a7e0957b398c8d3681627", "ja": "やったー☆　それじゃ、これからみんなでお買い物\nね！　ほら{$P$}も、早く早く！", "zh": "耶～☆那么大家接下来可以一起去逛街了！\n喂，{$P$}也别楞着，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1044_p", "source_sha256": "ab8aa836c818da0461baadec732143a2f69880a41bc21f47fb9ccb671d26514d", "ja": "え、俺も？　朝の話って本気だったのか？", "zh": "咦？我也要去？早上说的事情是认真的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "3d010bc818b7ede88d45c0ce8d4cd4cabc410c3ee4f4c32f1ca6ac3ba9cfae9b", "ja": "ワオ！　そういうことなら、ワタシもサンセーだヨー♪\nここからはショッピングタイムネ！", "zh": "哇喔！这样的话，那我也赞成喔～♪\n接下来就是逛街的时间了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4ed0090be7396df2f4b33a1f42cd0c2fcb6ad5baa0b6810f502fa6c10592fa9a", "ja": "わかりました！　それじゃ\n美希ちゃん、案内は私に任せてくださいね♪", "zh": "我知道了！那么美希，\n让我来带路吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1047_045kar", "source_sha256": "ffb6fee5ddf5768cfce42ef1b1316247f5af52764f5a6231a464c4bfb3af05c2", "ja": "で、でも……、春香さん。美希ちゃん、まだ1回しか\n踊ってないのに……本当にいいんでしょうか……？", "zh": "可、可是……春香，美希她才跳了一次而已……\n这样真的可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1048_001har", "source_sha256": "2e87b7625b2c39c992c58cbe893b60197b798d815bd0ae7f48cd41765017fc97", "ja": "いいと思うよ。美希は撮影だけど、可憐ちゃんたちは\n朝から踊ってたんだし。休まないとね♪", "zh": "我觉得无妨。虽然美希是去忙拍摄，\n但可怜你们从早上就不停跳到现在，得休息一下才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1049_045kar", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1050_p", "source_sha256": "575e80459a00d9f40bab51982e58ecb466b4b92e0b6e7abdf8f403e8b436ff12", "ja": "（劇場から少し歩いた所に翼がおススメしてくれた\n店はあった。……たしかにオシャレな服が多いな）", "zh": "（翼推荐的店就在离剧场不远的地方。\n……里面的衣服确实都挺时尚的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1051_045kar", "source_sha256": "00efe56ee4ffb64a14aabe47a7b52dd0e9e362d011b4fc8301e43b7499fc11d1", "ja": "あ……このリボン、可愛い……。\nレースも細かくて、素敵だな……♪", "zh": "啊……这个缎带真可爱……\n蕾丝也很细致，真漂亮……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1052_018ele", "source_sha256": "f2a6a3e4bbfe76b811905900781e42da62290dd03ddff90460b2e99aff3da456", "ja": "ねえねえカレン。あのキャミソールとかどうかナ？\nゼッタイ似合うヨ！", "zh": "欸欸，可怜，那件小可爱你觉得怎么样？\n你穿起来一定很好看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1053_045kar", "source_sha256": "394ee4a0a1f9c247e6d0771ff707a1077a33d24fd90a6b1ce2f27be1ae2f82c4", "ja": "どれですか？　……ひゃっ！？\nむ、むむ、胸元が、開きすぎです～～！", "zh": "哪件啊？呀啊……！？\n胸、胸胸、胸口的部分太暴露了～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1054_001har", "source_sha256": "8e01ccdbd3f2bf49e632e83b82a9e517653bbf5c19a9fa01dd4f46dac3ee6205", "ja": "わ。でも可憐ちゃんなら……、似合うかも！\nね、試着してみたら？", "zh": "哇，但可怜穿起来……应该会很好看！\n欸，试穿一下嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1055_003mik", "source_sha256": "73314fafa7353268aef28a938abe05c629a59d345f2c470c2f5050c8185cc9ec", "ja": "あっ！　ねえねえ、{$P$}！\nあそこに飾ってある帽子、ミキに似合うって思う？", "zh": "啊！欸欸，{$P$}！\n你觉得那顶帽子，美希戴起来会好看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1056_p", "source_sha256": "4a755f1633119c3e44d314a38b960d63ddbf2b369b477d9985d1b8ba84e995df", "ja": "うん？　ああ、そうだな。\n髪の色との相性もよさそうだし、いいと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯？啊，这个嘛，\n跟你的发色感觉也挺搭的，我觉得不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1057_003mik", "source_sha256": "be078437dd0e282aaf70c5b804b5987a3608e45f6627ee59260742c13d410edf", "ja": "あはっ、やっぱり？　{$P$}、\nミキと心が通じてるの☆", "zh": "啊哈，果然你也这样想？\n{$P$}跟美希心有灵犀呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1058_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3a963e67e8c883950fab9bd43e1d71024b8aeb9e0c6e2b5959fa049531734e1c", "ja": "あ～、カワイイ帽子～！　いいないいな～。\n美希ちゃん、わたしにも選んでよ～。", "zh": "啊～好可爱的帽子～！好羡慕喔～\n美希，也帮我选一下啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1059_003mik", "source_sha256": "4b4803aea877bd2b4e9152140944298cf58a80227c3da6533dd671bd3e2f495f", "ja": "翼には、あそこに飾ってあるお花柄のトップスとか、\n似合うって思うな。", "zh": "美希觉得那件花朵图案的上衣，\n挺适合翼哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1060_016tsu", "source_sha256": "695cd80e6bf2504c28192830ada56eee86f1b896ea88731b6a71cbf37bd2065f", "ja": "えっ、あの黒いのですか？　自分じゃ選ばない系だけど\n……美希ちゃんのおススメなら、試してみようかな？", "zh": "咦？那件黑色的吗？虽然是我自己不会挑的款式……\n既然美希推荐，我就试试看好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1061_018ele", "source_sha256": "cc124ee256beb042dcfa9d5a61b04c18f1b115846d32dc580628a52355415e02", "ja": "あそこのペイズリーのワンピースもステキだヨ！\nワタシ、近くで見てくるネ！", "zh": "那件变形虫花纹的连身裙也很棒耶！\n我要靠近点看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1062_p", "source_sha256": "053981f6b1c20200e4c81c6f43272f301f5395c26c7027296585a6b18d7f0c2d", "ja": "（ま、いいリフレッシュになってるみたいだな……）", "zh": "（嗯，看来大家都有充分地放松休息……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1063_016tsu", "source_sha256": "20690ed4715bd196870c52648821011cb3659cc0bcf0d734136a904f83ad6141", "ja": "でも、さすが美希ちゃんだなぁ。\nお買い物にも付き合ってくれて、余裕って感じですね！", "zh": "是说……真不愧是美希呢。\n还可以陪我们出来逛街，感觉你游刃有余呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1064_003mik", "source_sha256": "004858b8d92abfe0e24eda18261f9e897525a70687cbda511211a2e570ff6856", "ja": "ミキ、さっきはお疲れモードだったから余裕ないよ？\n今はもう充電したから、お元気モードだけど♪", "zh": "美希刚才是疲劳模式，所以不算游刃有余哦。\n但现在已经充饱电了，是活力模式♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1065_016tsu", "source_sha256": "49c82d1c7c5d3fc85b4c3d0bacbf415df43489c92124d60b1d815f6d3528d011", "ja": "お疲れモードでも、ダンスもすぐに覚えちゃうし。\nやっぱりすごいですよー。", "zh": "就算是疲劳模式，也能马上记熟舞步。\n果然好厉害呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1066_003mik", "source_sha256": "1b1bbc009732f7e4365b203b0cbf3f9bd710f76681f47f35d7450d87e297574a", "ja": "ミキもダンスは、可憐に教えてもらったの。\nそれに、翼もダンス、全部覚えたって言ってなかった？", "zh": "舞步也是可怜教美希的啊。\n而且，翼你不是也说自己把舞步都记起来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1067_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f8f5211a805c1b74e9491a1ae9ff283741d886065e3d3b56def61aa0589df794", "ja": "言いましたけど、あれは春香さんの教え方が上手だった\nからですよ～。美希ちゃんとは違うっていうか。", "zh": "我是有这么说没错，但那都是因为春香教得好～\n跟美希是不能相提并论的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1068_003mik", "source_sha256": "91f3b0c889837ea5acd8e7997e9d07173f5f16d394963ff5535a4fd43393f720", "ja": "おんなじって思うな。可憐のお手本も、翼とエレナの\nダンスも、とっても良かったの。", "zh": "美希倒觉得都一样呢，不管是可怜的示范，\n还是翼和艾琳娜的舞步都很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1069_003mik", "source_sha256": "60110952d0e7379da7ff3a74197dec5dceb8bb418d934cd0e5708ca947a3a0b5", "ja": "ミキはただ、一生懸命覚えただけってカンジ♪", "zh": "而美希只是拚命记下来而已喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1070_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9c2eeb3a5cbb16c7de7e46cdb34089990967c1e30e8fd72589d49e2ccae7fd6d", "ja": "一生懸命ですか？　でも、見たのも踊ったのも1回で、\nすぐお買い物に来ちゃったのに……？", "zh": "拚命吗？但你只有看一遍、跳一遍，\n就陪我们来逛街了耶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1071_p", "source_sha256": "12ff3f20d4abea365028c046cea27f14f6823344b827c9ee61ffe6bc0ded15a2", "ja": "翼、たしかに今は遊びに来てるけど、\nレッスンでの美希は本当に一生懸命だったと思うよ。", "zh": "翼，我们目前确实是在放松没错，\n但我觉得美希在练习的当下是真的很拚命喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1072_p", "source_sha256": "304f23916e0360ae236f03805847af0b6804b384ff9c12b2bf8ecab665b900a4", "ja": "たぶん一瞬、全力で本気を出したんだ。\n……そして一瞬で出し終わったけど。", "zh": "美希大概是在一瞬间全力以赴使出了真本事。\n……然后在一瞬间就耗尽了体力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1073_016tsu", "source_sha256": "baa71d3c06e72a53f57c69445192b2fb7b0e7bcac44cf4835435024ebee96878", "ja": "全力……。でもでも、美希ちゃんて、センター公演が\n決まっても、あんまりはりきってなかったですよね？", "zh": "全力以赴……可是可是，就算确定要举办\nCenter公演，美希也都感觉没在紧张不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1074_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3eac4bbe3838d185d3e397c8f38d21a75613a07d99226cc5838fc0824dba3681", "ja": "なのに、全力で本気って……どうして？", "zh": "但你却说她全力以赴拿出真本事……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1075_003mik", "source_sha256": "130ad71c1cf55c021cfc09ecfc8778456914d40fdb06b598662d9fb4b23e8e30", "ja": "ミキ、わりといつもホンキだよ？　大きなステージの\nセンターでも。小さなステージの端っこでも。", "zh": "美希其实总是很认真的喔！\n不管是在大舞台当Center，还是在小舞台当陪衬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1076_003mik", "source_sha256": "384dcd0175adcbb9e206f8060a39d16396cd44234b8e8a445eb343d1e59efbb4", "ja": "だって、どんなライブでも、\nステージのミキは……アイドルだから！", "zh": "因为无论哪种演唱会，\n站上舞台的美希……就是偶像啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1078_003mik", "source_sha256": "f19bb4c6c19392cff3262fb3d6078ede7da4b08c1140a6ea7245cbe2b54d064d", "ja": "あ、でも、劇場はちょっとトクベツなの。\n別に、センターじゃなくてもね。……あはっ♪", "zh": "啊，不过，剧场算是有点特别的。\n就算撇开Center这点不提也是……啊哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1080_p", "source_sha256": "18404638de94e15bb37ec0ddefab58b66891667e79791af4f25c251828e7874a", "ja": "（こうして、美希は仕事の合間を縫うように\nレッスンを続け……）", "zh": "（就这样，美希继续利用工作空档\n练习演唱会的歌舞……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1081_p", "source_sha256": "25a7d9a84514271917a742c2fe910e041fb7131b6a17ef831d6be98378ae7583", "ja": "（ついに美希のセンター公演前日を迎えた）", "zh": "（终于到了美希Center公演的前一天。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1082_p", "source_sha256": "5878d494a2242ba3f334927afe71c6411a12ea4fde5b73126577c914ab322ae1", "ja": "さて、翼たち3人は先に上がったし……。\n春香も、帰り支度は済んだみたいだな。", "zh": "我看看，翼她们三个已经先离开……\n春香好像也准备好要回家了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1083_001har", "source_sha256": "61b45040bda6cd18faa8890b869b0811103d9aef5323c8cf8783caa3dbe23d5b", "ja": "はい。私もそろそろ失礼しますね。\n電車が行っちゃうので。それにしても……", "zh": "是的，我也差不多要先离开了，不然会错过电车。\n但话说回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1084_001har", "source_sha256": "5ef89d7cb584bd7944469ace01d938a0dc4069cb1e225b519a8bf5d1951d83e3", "ja": "最後までみんな、はりきってましたね～♪\n翼ちゃんとエレナちゃんの呼吸ピッタリで！", "zh": "大家直到最后都十分起劲呢～♪\n小翼和艾琳娜一整个默契十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1085_001har", "source_sha256": "a64f7f40dad75a305c5374adabcddbfa517aea80ad07b6df5b34b5f7c23ec7b7", "ja": "美希、公演の最後の曲は、私も可憐ちゃんと\n一緒に袖で踊ってるからねっ。えへへ♪", "zh": "美希，公演的最后一首歌，\n我也会跟可怜一起在侧边跳舞哦，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1086_p", "source_sha256": "ce8b7211786724e2e77bf8e91c614a202c74e7671113889aa69cc17d769c2178", "ja": "そういえば、あの曲の振り付けも、美希がいない間に\n先に春香と可憐で覚えてくれたんだっけ。", "zh": "说到这个，那首歌的舞步，也是春香和可怜\n趁美希不在的时候先记熟的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1087_003mik", "source_sha256": "2ddacf958678cb58d1304097cf6b05b9f869fd9aa8d8c93513ca208ccccae225", "ja": "ミキ、あんまり一緒にレッスンできなかったけど、\n春香たちのおかげで困らなかったの。ありがとねっ！", "zh": "美希虽然跟大家一起练习的时间不多，\n但多亏有春香你们，所以没遇上什么问题，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1088_001har", "source_sha256": "eb1bb05e3c7bae51cd948451e9419cc6d3f3379c41893209332e78603ce895d9", "ja": "うーん、困らなかったのは、美希だからじゃないかな？\n振り付けが変わっても、すぐに覚えちゃうし。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得是因为美希厉害才没遇上问题吧？\n就算舞步有变动，也能马上记熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1089_001har", "source_sha256": "d94fc89266b3d497673351687ea8151503800fa98d97c7df78d4808c437b5c10", "ja": "いつもながら、美希は結局どうにかしちゃうよね♪", "zh": "美希还是老样子，总能摆平一切呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1090_003mik", "source_sha256": "148eaf7f72d07cf9bcb2f9257e3c15da4024a669b170018d51186864385d2f3e", "ja": "あはっ、春香に言われたくないってカンジ☆", "zh": "啊哈，别这么说，春香也很厉害啊☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1091_001har", "source_sha256": "fc8e96493e505961c260f9d48f0bf03407c8b653a78ed1775ef97b1ec2981c5b", "ja": "ふふっ、私はバタバタしちゃうだけで……あ、時間！\nそれじゃあ、お先ねっ。お疲れさまでしたー！", "zh": "呵呵，我只会弄得自己手忙脚乱而已……啊，没时间了！\n那我先走啰，大家辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1092_003mik", "source_sha256": "87c066eb91e27c611ce0de8e89d7ce1acae848475418b0161627295750b18b8f", "ja": "うん、お疲れさまなの！\nまた明日ね♪", "zh": "嗯，辛苦了！\n明天见哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1093_p", "source_sha256": "27565c93cfe8ba7411fe1324e5528f472818d6958a3ec22325d5d3c6be7a9bda", "ja": "さてと。美希はまだ帰らないのか？", "zh": "好了，美希你还不回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1094_003mik", "source_sha256": "ce6b59c8424ece9982878aabe3b38a6eee86ee365e09a030ce777d28796af4a5", "ja": "うん……あのね、{$P$}。知ってた？\nミキね、ちょっとウソついちゃったかも。", "zh": "嗯……那个啊，{$P$}，你知道吗？\n美希跟大家撒了一个小谎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1095_p", "source_sha256": "357e687a2ddd6fde1e55f11fdddc66f421d9e60b7e9eb55da8246ed063b79e3a", "ja": "ウソ？", "zh": "撒谎？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1096_003mik", "source_sha256": "8ccddabbd9c9df25127fe3706ac680ca0ec5ff6c1264a3e4454a168d710508f1", "ja": "劇場はちょっとトクベツって。\nでも、ちょっとじゃなくなってたみたい。", "zh": "美希之前说过，剧场对我算有点特别的存在，\n可是，现在好像已经不是有点特别了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1097_003mik", "source_sha256": "f4a995b1eb8f4db1d33842d60f8b733be9b4e286cc82e71f74fc17fb9eb588a3", "ja": "きっと、すっごくトクベツ。\nどうしてか、わかる？", "zh": "而是变得非常特别。\n你懂这是为什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_1098", "source_sha256": "12721cc70084414d736c23c2ce640aca2694f3b9612d9155afa089d89943480c", "ja": "わかる……かも", "zh": "好像……能懂", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_2000_p", "source_sha256": "82fd3d376c1fd30ba2db1fc818d7770676cc8238d690132a0a88afb08255fcaf", "ja": "うーん。わかるような、わからないような感じかな。\n劇場はたぶん、美希の大切な人たちが集まる場所で……", "zh": "嗯……该说有点懂又不是很懂吧，但我猜……\n大概是因为剧场这个地方聚集了美希珍视的人们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_2001_p", "source_sha256": "f191dfe3e5f378254ef7ff65c7bf15181202aa1de00375f74b00c9ad22aa3c67", "ja": "だからこそ、美希が一番輝ける場所。\nそういうことかな、って思うんだけど。", "zh": "所以是美希最能发光发热的地方，\n应该是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "208dc1c06e2dcd16a96afe56ce09bc0f4dd96d39ff58cf674f294e8020c2dee5", "ja": "……あはっ。さすがはハニーなの♪", "zh": "……啊哈，真不愧是HONEY♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_045_2003_p", "source_sha256": "8ec55a31addeab03b37d4a6dedd7dc758ce0ff843673dc70997b7792cd2794f8", "ja": "てことは、正解か？", "zh": "也就是我猜对了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
